%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 612 792
%%Title: Print Head Maintenance Test Page
%%Creator: nixos_config
%%Pages: 1
%%EndComments

% Weekly print-head maintenance page for the Epson ET-4850 (4-color CMYK).
% Solid CMYK + secondary blocks and a grayscale ramp exercise every ink
% channel; fine lines reveal clogged nozzles (missing line = clogged head).

/Helvetica-Bold findfont 20 scalefont setfont
54 732 moveto (Epson ET-4850 - Print Head Maintenance) show

/Helvetica findfont 11 scalefont setfont
54 712 moveto (Weekly test page - exercises cyan, magenta, yellow, black) show
54 698 moveto (Streaky blocks or missing lines = clogged nozzles: run nozzle check + clean) show

% --- primary CMYK blocks (120 x 110 pts each) ---
1 0 0 0 setcmykcolor        % cyan
54 560 120 110 rectfill
0 1 0 0 setcmykcolor        % magenta
182 560 120 110 rectfill
0 0 1 0 setcmykcolor        % yellow
310 560 120 110 rectfill
0 0 0 1 setcmykcolor        % black
438 560 120 110 rectfill

/Helvetica findfont 10 scalefont setfont
0 0 0 0 setcmykcolor
54 548 moveto (Cyan) show
182 548 moveto (Magenta) show
310 548 moveto (Yellow) show
438 548 moveto (Black) show

% --- secondary colors ---
0 1 1 0 setcmykcolor        % red
54 410 120 110 rectfill
1 0 1 0 setcmykcolor        % green
182 410 120 110 rectfill
1 1 0 0 setcmykcolor        % blue
310 410 120 110 rectfill
0 0 0 0.5 setcmykcolor      % 50% gray
438 410 120 110 rectfill

0 0 0 0 setcmykcolor
54 398 moveto (Red) show
182 398 moveto (Green) show
310 398 moveto (Blue) show
438 398 moveto (50% Gray) show

% --- grayscale ramp (8 steps) ---
/Helvetica findfont 10 scalefont setfont
0 0 0 0 setcmykcolor
54 360 moveto (Grayscale ramp:) show

0 0 0 0 setcmykcolor 54 310 63 40 rectfill
0 0 0 0.14 setcmykcolor 117 310 63 40 rectfill
0 0 0 0.29 setcmykcolor 180 310 63 40 rectfill
0 0 0 0.43 setcmykcolor 243 310 63 40 rectfill
0 0 0 0.57 setcmykcolor 306 310 63 40 rectfill
0 0 0 0.71 setcmykcolor 369 310 63 40 rectfill
0 0 0 0.86 setcmykcolor 432 310 63 40 rectfill
0 0 0 1 setcmykcolor 495 310 63 40 rectfill

% --- fine lines (nozzle check) ---
/Helvetica findfont 10 scalefont setfont
0 0 0 0 setcmykcolor
54 270 moveto (Fine lines - missing lines indicate clogged nozzles:) show

0.5 setlinewidth

0 0 0 1 setcmykcolor
54 246 moveto 204 246 lineto stroke
54 240 moveto 204 240 lineto stroke

1 0 0 0 setcmykcolor
54 228 moveto 204 228 lineto stroke
54 222 moveto 204 222 lineto stroke

0 1 0 0 setcmykcolor
54 210 moveto 204 210 lineto stroke
54 204 moveto 204 204 lineto stroke

0 0 1 0 setcmykcolor
54 192 moveto 204 192 lineto stroke
54 186 moveto 204 186 lineto stroke

% --- footer ---
/Helvetica findfont 9 scalefont setfont
0 0 0 0 setcmykcolor
54 60 moveto (Weekly print-head maintenance page - uses a small amount of ink) show

showpage
%%EOF
